> User bellabride2018 (287346)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"2.99.79.79","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f59894946141bfca675333d206f21fa2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone and welcome,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are also planning our wedding in Ocho Rios in 2015 but in December. We have 80 to 100 guests and the location will be the gorgeous Laughing Waters and the ceremony is possibly Prospect Chapel. &amp;nbsp;I also have no idea what favours to give my guests. I want either something they can use or something they can truly treasure, something handmade like a special Jam.......hellllpp&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844219,"PostDate":1397447521,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone and welcome,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are also planning our wedding in Ocho Rios in 2015 but in December. We have 80 to 100 guests and the location will be the gorgeous Laughing Waters and the ceremony is possibly Prospect Chapel. \u00a0I also have no idea what favours to give my guests. I want either something they can use or something they can truly treasure, something handmade like a special Jam.......hellllpp<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divaexquisitehair@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.43.173.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390084734,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276188.jpg?_r=1399653269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HappilyEverAfter","Id":276188,"Name":"HappilyEverAfter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"24bc07cebfbeef9e19410fd5874ba895","RawContent":"[quote name=\"HappilyEverAfter\" post=\"1844219\" timestamp=\"1397465521\"]\nHi Everyone and welcome,\n\nWe are also planning our wedding in Ocho Rios in 2015 but in December. We have 80 to 100 guests and the location will be the gorgeous Laughing Waters and the ceremony is possibly Prospect Chapel.  I also have no idea what favours to give my guests. I want either something they can use or something they can truly treasure, something handmade like a special Jam.......hellllpp[\/quote]\nHi.  We were going to go with little tins of jerk sauce, but we decided to do beach candles.  I did a google search for beach candles wedding favors and looked at the images....beautiful candles. And you can personalize them (some websites)  \n\nHere are a couple links:\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.myweddingfavors.com\/images\/product\/20125BL_Seashell_L.jpg\"]http:\/\/www.myweddingfavors.com\/images\/product\/20125BL_Seashell_L.jpg[\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.myweddingfavors.com\/images\/Product\/samllsandshelltealightholderL.jpg\"]http:\/\/www.myweddingfavors.com\/images\/Product\/samllsandshelltealightholderL.jpg[\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/thumbs1.ebaystatic.com\/d\/l225\/m\/mV0kgGJN5eDdTwzhBsVlQ4A.jpg\"]http:\/\/thumbs1.ebaystatic.com\/d\/l225\/m\/mV0kgGJN5eDdTwzhBsVlQ4A.jpg[\/url]\n\nBy the way, my Aunt just told me that Groupon now has a wedding section. Dresses, jewelry, stationary and few other things. Just an FYI","Attachments":[],"Id":1844261,"PostDate":1397472938,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>HappilyEverAfter, on 14 April 2014 - 03:52 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Everyone and welcome,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are also planning our wedding in Ocho Rios in 2015 but in December. We have 80 to 100 guests and the location will be the gorgeous Laughing Waters and the ceremony is possibly Prospect Chapel. \u00a0I also have no idea what favours to give my guests. I want either something they can use or something they can truly treasure, something handmade like a special Jam.......hellllpp<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi. \u00a0We were going to go with little tins of jerk sauce, but we decided to do beach candles. \u00a0I did a google search for beach candles wedding favors and looked at the images....beautiful candles. And you can personalize them (some websites) \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are a couple links:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.myweddingfavors.com\/images\/product\/20125BL_Seashell_L.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.mywedding..._Seashell_L.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.myweddingfavors.com\/images\/Product\/samllsandshelltealightholderL.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.mywedding...ightholderL.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/thumbs1.ebaystatic.com\/d\/l225\/m\/mV0kgGJN5eDdTwzhBsVlQ4A.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/thumbs1.ebays...TwzhBsVlQ4A.jpg<\/a><\/p><br \/><p>By the way, my Aunt just told me that Groupon now has a wedding section. Dresses, jewelry, stationary and few other things. Just an FYI<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brahamf@student.wpunj.edu","IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385496427,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275352.jpg?_r=1437768881","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Francine Braham","Id":275352,"Name":"Francine Braham","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.63.14.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a714d914bda07f782b695e08c588ec2b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m not quite a 2015 bride but almost!&amp;nbsp; Were getting Married December 2014 at Sandals Negril Jamaica.&amp;nbsp; Were super excited and still lots to plan!&amp;nbsp; Its just the&amp;nbsp; 2 of us NO guest!! Any advice suggestions on anything is greatly appreciated.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845258,"PostDate":1397983102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone!\u00a0 I'm not quite a 2015 bride but almost!\u00a0 Were getting Married December 2014 at Sandals Negril Jamaica.\u00a0 Were super excited and still lots to plan!\u00a0 Its just the\u00a0 2 of us NO guest!! Any advice suggestions on anything is greatly appreciated.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alidodson35@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.63.14.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397980789,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"futuremrsh14","Id":277656,"Name":"futuremrsh14","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c58c77681c7eac6c5cb628325264e7d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"futuremrsh14\" post=\"1845258\" timestamp=\"1398001102\"]\nHi Everyone!  I&#039;m not quite a 2015 bride but almost!  Were getting Married December 2014 at Sandals Negril Jamaica.  Were super excited and still lots to plan!  Its just the  2 of us NO guest!! Any advice suggestions on anything is greatly appreciated.[\/quote]\nCongrats!! Make sure you check out the photographers work so that you will have beautiful pictures.  I&#039;m assuming the resort&#039;s wedding coordinator will be organizing most things so just relax and have fun!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1845368,"PostDate":1398078511,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>futuremrsh14, on 20 April 2014 - 08:38 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Everyone!\u00a0 I'm not quite a 2015 bride but almost!\u00a0 Were getting Married December 2014 at Sandals Negril Jamaica.\u00a0 Were super excited and still lots to plan!\u00a0 Its just the\u00a0 2 of us NO guest!! Any advice suggestions on anything is greatly appreciated.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats!! Make sure you check out the photographers work so that you will have beautiful pictures. \u00a0I'm assuming the resort's wedding coordinator will be organizing most things so just relax and have fun!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brahamf@student.wpunj.edu","IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385496427,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275352.jpg?_r=1437768881","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Francine Braham","Id":275352,"Name":"Francine Braham","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.35.211.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0b0fb894834a984d4b7acef8f0f9b5d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;good morning ladies, although I am not&amp;nbsp; a 2015 bride, I&amp;nbsp; am however a Jamaica bride(we girls gotta stick together no matter what year) lol. &lt;u&gt;My wedding is June 7, 2014&lt;\/u&gt; at Sandals Whitehouse. we were able to do sandals, because we didn&#039;t have any children attending so it worked for us. my biggest with them was all the great inclusions that I get\/got from them and I truly, truly love , love, love, did I mention I love the property.Because they also have a themed night every night, it also gives my guest lots of things to do onsite and slop party everynight on resort.Since I&#039;m so close I&#039;m pretty much done with everything. if anyone needs any help\/ideas, let me know, i&#039;ll do all I can. for my gifts\/favors I did several things.&amp;nbsp; for my pre wedding dinner, I&#039;m giving a gift bags(custom kraft bag) inside I did double wall tumbler with custom label on it, inside tumbler I&#039;m putting margarita pack with custom label on it. I&#039;m giving key card holder with lanyard, a thank you card, a custom cd, and I made door hangers,one side says \"please do&amp;nbsp; not disturb, we are resting for trevor and Kellie&#039;s wedding, flip side \"please do not disturb we are recovering from Trevor and kellie&#039;s wedding\". On the table for reception I did message in a bottle thank you&#039;s.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846167,"PostDate":1398409686,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>good morning ladies, although I am not\u00a0 a 2015 bride, I\u00a0 am however a Jamaica bride(we girls gotta stick together no matter what year) lol. <u>My wedding is June 7, 2014<\/u> at Sandals Whitehouse. we were able to do sandals, because we didn't have any children attending so it worked for us. my biggest with them was all the great inclusions that I get\/got from them and I truly, truly love , love, love, did I mention I love the property.Because they also have a themed night every night, it also gives my guest lots of things to do onsite and slop party everynight on resort.Since I'm so close I'm pretty much done with everything. if anyone needs any help\/ideas, let me know, i'll do all I can. for my gifts\/favors I did several things.\u00a0 for my pre wedding dinner, I'm giving a gift bags(custom kraft bag) inside I did double wall tumbler with custom label on it, inside tumbler I'm putting margarita pack with custom label on it. I'm giving key card holder with lanyard, a thank you card, a custom cd, and I made door hangers,one side says \"please do\u00a0 not disturb, we are resting for trevor and Kellie's wedding, flip side \"please do not disturb we are recovering from Trevor and kellie's wedding\". On the table for reception I did message in a bottle thank you's.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shugapop12@aol.com","IpAddress":"66.87.100.226","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1369898825,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shugapop1","Id":270119,"Name":"shugapop1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.145.62.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa108d404a7e55917cf0dfb34d61948e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Francine Braham\" post=\"1844261\" timestamp=\"1397490938\"]\nHi.  We were going to go with little tins of jerk sauce, but we decided to do beach candles.  I did a google search for beach candles wedding favors and looked at the images....beautiful candles. And you can personalize them (some websites)  \n\nHere are a couple links:\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.myweddingfavors.com\/images\/product\/20125BL_Seashell_L.jpg\"]http:\/\/www.myweddingfavors.com\/images\/product\/20125BL_Seashell_L.jpg[\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.myweddingfavors.com\/images\/Product\/samllsandshelltealightholderL.jpg\"]http:\/\/www.myweddingfavors.com\/images\/Product\/samllsandshelltealightholderL.jpg[\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/thumbs1.ebaystatic.com\/d\/l225\/m\/mV0kgGJN5eDdTwzhBsVlQ4A.jpg\"]http:\/\/thumbs1.ebaystatic.com\/d\/l225\/m\/mV0kgGJN5eDdTwzhBsVlQ4A.jpg[\/url]\n\nBy the way, my Aunt just told me that Groupon now has a wedding section. Dresses, jewelry, stationary and few other things. Just an FYI[\/quote]WOW \n\nThe candle idea sounds so  beautiful. Such a good idea and something that will last too. (well until they burn it out!) Thanks for the groupon tip too, didnt know that. Im really excited. I just want it to be so perfect and intimate and I have done loads of research on vendors. However I am stuck with who to use to capture the event in HD. Im stuck between \n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/[\/url]\n[url=\"http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/wedding-cinematography-2\/\"]http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/wedding-cinematography-2\/[\/url]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.yourdaycinema.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.yourdaycinema.com\/[\/url]\n\nDecisions decisions....!!!!\n[quote name=\"shugapop1\" post=\"1846167\" timestamp=\"1398427686\"]\ngood morning ladies, although I am not  a 2015 bride, I  am however a Jamaica bride(we girls gotta stick together no matter what year) lol. [u]My wedding is June 7, 2014[\/u] at Sandals Whitehouse. we were able to do sandals, because we didn&#039;t have any children attending so it worked for us. my biggest with them was all the great inclusions that I get\/got from them and I truly, truly love , love, love, did I mention I love the property.Because they also have a themed night every night, it also gives my guest lots of things to do onsite and slop party everynight on resort.Since I&#039;m so close I&#039;m pretty much done with everything. if anyone needs any help\/ideas, let me know, i&#039;ll do all I can. for my gifts\/favors I did several things.  for my pre wedding dinner, I&#039;m giving a gift bags(custom kraft bag) inside I did double wall tumbler with custom label on it, inside tumbler I&#039;m putting margarita pack with custom label on it. I&#039;m giving key card holder with lanyard, a thank you card, a custom cd, and I made door hangers,one side says \"please do  not disturb, we are resting for trevor and Kellie&#039;s wedding, flip side \"please do not disturb we are recovering from Trevor and kellie&#039;s wedding\". On the table for reception I did message in a bottle thank you&#039;s.[\/quote]Congratulations Shugapop1 \n\nYour wedding is so close now, you must be really excited. Im excited for you!\n\nShow some pics later on if you can. I love the idea of gift bags and would love some help and tips from you too.\n\nCongrats again.","Attachments":[],"Id":1846806,"PostDate":1398574381,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Francine Braham, on 14 April 2014 - 10:55 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi. \u00a0We were going to go with little tins of jerk sauce, but we decided to do beach candles. \u00a0I did a google search for beach candles wedding favors and looked at the images....beautiful candles. And you can personalize them (some websites) \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are a couple links:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.myweddingfavors.com\/images\/product\/20125BL_Seashell_L.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.mywedding..._Seashell_L.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.myweddingfavors.com\/images\/Product\/samllsandshelltealightholderL.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.mywedding...ightholderL.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/thumbs1.ebaystatic.com\/d\/l225\/m\/mV0kgGJN5eDdTwzhBsVlQ4A.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/thumbs1.ebays...TwzhBsVlQ4A.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<br><p>By the way, my Aunt just told me that Groupon now has a wedding section. Dresses, jewelry, stationary and few other things. Just an FYI<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>WOW\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The candle idea sounds so \u00a0beautiful. Such a good idea and something that will last too. (well until they burn it out!) Thanks for the groupon tip too, didnt know that. Im really excited. I just want it to be so perfect and intimate and I have done loads of research on vendors. However I am stuck with who to use to capture the event in HD. Im stuck between\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/wedding-cinematography-2\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/elitemediacon...nematography-2\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.yourdaycinema.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.yourdaycinema.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Decisions decisions....!!!!<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>shugapop1, on 25 April 2014 - 07:08 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>good morning ladies, although I am not\u00a0 a 2015 bride, I\u00a0 am however a Jamaica bride(we girls gotta stick together no matter what year) lol. <u>My wedding is June 7, 2014<\/u> at Sandals Whitehouse. we were able to do sandals, because we didn't have any children attending so it worked for us. my biggest with them was all the great inclusions that I get\/got from them and I truly, truly love , love, love, did I mention I love the property.Because they also have a themed night every night, it also gives my guest lots of things to do onsite and slop party everynight on resort.Since I'm so close I'm pretty much done with everything. if anyone needs any help\/ideas, let me know, i'll do all I can. for my gifts\/favors I did several things.\u00a0 for my pre wedding dinner, I'm giving a gift bags(custom kraft bag) inside I did double wall tumbler with custom label on it, inside tumbler I'm putting margarita pack with custom label on it. I'm giving key card holder with lanyard, a thank you card, a custom cd, and I made door hangers,one side says \"please do\u00a0 not disturb, we are resting for trevor and Kellie's wedding, flip side \"please do not disturb we are recovering from Trevor and kellie's wedding\". On the table for reception I did message in a bottle thank you's.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Congratulations Shugapop1\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your wedding is so close now, you must be really excited. Im excited for you!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Show some pics later on if you can. I love the idea of gift bags and would love some help and tips from you too.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats again.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divaexquisitehair@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.43.173.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390084734,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276188.jpg?_r=1399653269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HappilyEverAfter","Id":276188,"Name":"HappilyEverAfter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.50.95.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"582372dfe27429f76650814fa4e0982d","RawContent":"Hello everyone!! I will be getting married at Secrets Wild Orchid resort on Thanksgiving Day 2015!! So excited!! Love to see and share ideas!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1847801,"PostDate":1398937029,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello everyone!! I will be getting married at Secrets Wild Orchid resort on Thanksgiving Day 2015!! So excited!! Love to see and share ideas!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374596124,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd36b936b4ed43188eb74dce027907b5","RawContent":"Hi everyone....I am planning an October 2015 wedding....still trying to decide on the resorts. Looking at Secrets and Royalton White Sands. I will be going to Jamaica June 6th to Royalton White Sands for a site visit and I am hoping to visit Secrets again for a second tour. Hopefully, I will be able to make up my mind and book a site.","Attachments":[],"Id":1847824,"PostDate":1398945128,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone....I am planning an October 2015 wedding....still trying to decide on the resorts. Looking at Secrets and Royalton White Sands. I will be going to Jamaica June 6th to Royalton White Sands for a site visit and I am hoping to visit Secrets again for a second tour. Hopefully, I will be able to make up my mind and book a site. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397048522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f80388cf19f437eb83500d4156e96579","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone!&amp;nbsp; My fianc\u00e9 and I are going to Jamaica tomorrow to do site visits at the Riu Montego Bay and Royalton White Sands.&amp;nbsp; Fingers crossed that we love them both and can finally make a decision on where to have our wedding!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning to all the Jamaica brides!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847841,"PostDate":1398951885,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone!\u00a0 My fianc\u00e9 and I are going to Jamaica tomorrow to do site visits at the Riu Montego Bay and Royalton White Sands.\u00a0 Fingers crossed that we love them both and can finally make a decision on where to have our wedding!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning to all the Jamaica brides!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391786127,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1433950078","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ba48034fd65938bfad8e766fa64c2c0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"]....are you doing a site visit at the Palace (adult only) or the family RIU?&amp;nbsp; I stayed at the Riu Montego Bay last year for a girls trip.&amp;nbsp; Nice site but I didn&#039;t like where they placed the Gazebo for weddings.&amp;nbsp; The staff&amp;nbsp;was great.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please let me know how you like the Royalton White Sands.....and if possible, take pictures and post.&amp;nbsp; There are quite a few brides on here that&amp;nbsp;have chosen or are considering RWS.  &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have a safe trip and happy planning!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847852,"PostDate":1398956573,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a>....are you doing a site visit at the Palace (adult only) or the family RIU?\u00a0 I stayed at the Riu Montego Bay last year for a girls trip.\u00a0 Nice site but I didn't like where they placed the Gazebo for weddings.\u00a0 The staff\u00a0was great.\u00a0 \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Please let me know how you like the Royalton White Sands.....and if possible, take pictures and post.\u00a0 There are quite a few brides on here that\u00a0have chosen or are considering RWS.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have a safe trip and happy planning!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397048522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":137,"TotalPages":14,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":130},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":3,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
