ntego Bay. I&#039;m so confused about the dinner options. In regards to the private dinner at the steak restaurant... Is the fee $1000 plus you pay per person or $1000 flat?\n\n\nI know a lot of you have chose the option any help is appreciated!","Attachments":[],"Id":1907904,"PostDate":1448578345,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ladies I need some help!<br><br>\nI'm booked to have my wedding at Riu Montego Bay. I'm so confused about the dinner options. In regards to the private dinner at the steak restaurant... Is the fee $1000 plus you pay per person or $1000 flat?<br><br>\nI know a lot of you have chose the option any help is appreciated!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lau11888@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"71.167.187.147","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428959701,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Lau11888","Id":282732,"Name":"Lau11888","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79764","Title":"Riu Montego Bay","LastPostDate":1448578345},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":3,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
